<title>USA: Indiana Housing Finance bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Indiana Housing Finance bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>INDIANA HOUSING FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $41,185,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES D-1 (NON-AMT) AND D-2 (AMT)</p>
<p>THE ABOVE ACCOUNT IS NOW CLOSED.</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed on the serial bonds, and the bonds</p>
<p>are now free to trade.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>NatCity Capital Market</p>
<p>Samuel A. Ramirez &amp; Company, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
